<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-SUNDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-SUNDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(updates with Seattle victory)</p>
<p>Results of first-round NBA</p>
<p>playoff games on Sunday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>		  EASTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> MIAMI		104  Orlando	   87</p>
<p>(Miami leads best-of-five series 2-0)</p>
<p> CHICAGO	    109  Washington     104</p>
<p>(Chicago leads best-of-five series 2-0)</p>
<p> Detroit	     93  ATLANTA	   80</p>
<p>	 (best-of-five series tied 1-1)</p>
<p>		 WESTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> LA LAKERS	  107  Portland	  93</p>
<p>(Los Angeles leads best-of-five series 2-0)</p>
<p> SEATTLE	    122  Phoenix	   78</p>
<p>	 (best-of-five series tied 1-1)</p>
</text>
